    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/saaslauncher/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "SaasLauncher is a modern Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme for SaaS businesses, startups, software companies, digital agencies, technology companies, consultants, and modern service businesses. Built with the WordPress Site Editor and Gutenberg, it makes it easy to create professional websites without writing code. Use SaasLauncher as a SaaS website templates, startup website template, agency website template, business website template, software company website, technology websites, or high-converting SaaS landing page. It is designed for businesses launching software products, web applications, digital services, AI products, online platforms, and growing startups. Build faster with 70+ ready-to-use website sections and 50+ professionally designed starter templates. Create complete homepages, SaaS landing pages, product showcases, service pages, pricing sections, testimonials, team pages, portfolios, FAQs, lead-generation sections, and other marketing-focused layouts directly with the WordPress block editor. Powered by Cozy Blocks, SaasLauncher extends Gutenberg with 50+ advanced blocks for building flexible, feature-rich websites. The WordPress Site Editor gives you full control over headers, footers, templates, pages, layouts, colors, typography, and global styles without relying on complex page builders or custom coding. Whether you need a SaaS website template for a new product, an agency website template for a digital agency, a startup website for a growing company, or a modern business website for professional services, SaasLauncher provides a flexible foundation for building and launching your site faster. The theme features a clean, modern, responsive design built for professional online businesses and marketing-focused websites. It is WooCommerce-ready and compatible with popular WordPress plugins including Contact Form 7, WPForms, Rank Math SEO, Yoast SEO, and more. SaasLauncher is built with Full Site Editing, Gutenberg, reusable block patterns, and flexible customization in mind, making it a practical WordPress theme for SaaS startups, software companies, digital agencies, technology businesses, consultants, and modern service brands looking to create a fast, professional, and conversion-focused website. Explore more features, demos, and details about SaasLauncher at https://cozythemes.com/saaslauncher-wordpress-theme/"
    },
